      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doty%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The town sits along State Route 6, 18 miles west of Chehalis, and still hosts a general store, post office, and two churches that keep its cultural identity alive.",
